<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves rise in January.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves rise in January.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 113.617 trillion lire at end-January, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				    Jan 97	 Dec 96	 Jan 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    113.617	106.773	91.053</p>
<p>    Total assets		115.373	108.683	95.086</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	38.366	 38.366	40.257</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.756	  1.910	 4.033</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)     0.176	  0.364	 2.401</p>
</text>
